Subject: [PATCH] Add pagination to Overview Grid panels (Wazuh and Prowler)

Add a shared Pagination component and usePagination hook, and use them
in WazuhPanel and ProwlerPanel (5 items per page). Raise the Wazuh
alert feed cap from 10 to 50 in App.tsx so there is more than one page.

